---
// DetectorsBento.astro - Bento Grid of 18 Built-in Detectors
---

<section id="detectors" class="py-16 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyber-neon/10 border border-cyber-neon/30 text-cyber-neon text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase mb-3">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">verified_user</span>
      ZERO FALSE POSITIVES
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
      18 Built-in Detectors with <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-neon via-cyber-cyan to-cyber-purple">
        Mathematical Checksum Verification
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-cyber-muted text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <code class="font-mono text-cyber-neon text-sm">pii-veil</code> doesn't just guess with sloppy regex. Every entity is validated through cryptographic or standard mathematical checksums.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    
    <!-- Bento 1: Financial & Cards (Large) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-neon/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span class="text-3xl">💳</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-neon/10 text-cyber-neon border border-cyber-neon/30 font-bold">
          FINANCIAL CORE
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Banking & Payment Systems</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Validated through formal checksum standards. Discards random 16-digit sequences that fail mathematical validation.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Credit Cards <strong class="text-cyber-neon">(Luhn Mod-10)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • International IBAN <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(ISO 13616 Mod-97)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Argentine CBU & Banking Aliases
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 2: Regional National IDs (Large) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-cyan/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span class="text-3xl">🆔</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-cyan/10 text-cyber-cyan border border-cyber-cyan/30 font-bold">
          REGIONAL COMPLIANCE
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Government & Citizen Identifiers</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Strict regional modulo verification algorithms prevent false alerts on order IDs and invoices.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Spain DNI / NIE <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(Mod-23)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Argentina CUIT / CUIL <strong class="text-cyber-neon">(Mod-11)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Chile RUT <strong class="text-amber-400">(Mod-11)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • US Social Security (SSN)
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 3: Secrets & Cloud Keys -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-purple/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span class="text-3xl">🔑</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-purple/10 text-cyber-purple border border-cyber-purple/30 font-bold">
          DEVOPS & SECRETS
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Cloud Infrastructure & API Keys</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Detects sensitive credentials leaking into prompt logs, embeddings, or vector databases.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • OpenAI Keys (<code class="text-cyber-neon">sk-proj-*</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • AWS Access Keys (<code class="text-amber-400">AKIA*</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • DB URIs (<code class="text-cyber-cyan">postgres://, mongodb://, redis://</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Webhooks (Slack & Discord)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • PEM Private Keys & JWT Tokens
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 4: Personal Data & Telemetry -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-neon/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span class="text-3xl">🌐</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-neon/10 text-cyber-neon border border-cyber-neon/30 font-bold">
          PRIVACY & GDPR
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Telemetry, Logs & Contact Info</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Comprehensive scrubbing of communication metadata across multi-gigabyte log files and NDJSON streams.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • RFC 5322 Corporate & Personal Emails
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • International Phones (E.164 standard)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • IPv4 & IPv6 Addresses (with Allowlist support)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Hardware MAC Addresses
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
